# Local index cache — per-clone, regenerable, never source-of-truth (D-023).
# Includes seq.json + cache.db. The audit log moved to Postgres
# (rule_01KRKQDHWNWJAF4YKTMCB2A0D9). Files-not-directory pattern so the
# v13 connections pointer file (.doco/connections.md) can be re-included.
.doco/*
# v13: the connections pointer file IS committed
# (decision_01KS3DX190V93NGR3QQ37J8TVQ). Replaces the legacy DOCO.md.
!.doco/connections.md

